Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來只需要這麼做...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閃亮藥水就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:16.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 馬上就能見到健康的爸爸和媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:25.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告訴小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便幫我把湯藥帶過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:29.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:37.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小...小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:44.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:48.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:52.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉！吵醒你了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 真白 受你們照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我也說說 發生什麼好事情了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:11.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠治療國王和王妃的閃亮藥水 已經做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.23,0:01:17.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣大家就可以一起回去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:19.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！出發去藍天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1120,965)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}閃耀最亮星☆ 小空的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長！你沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 你做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不單單是靠我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是靠大伙齊心協力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 從深邃的黑暗中醒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是... 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像一直彷徨在某個地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:58.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 你沒事就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩位中了虛蜢達的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前一直陷入深眠之中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在已經不用再擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然已經會說話了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再叫一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主... 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,還得是爸爸媽媽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:43.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一家人團團圓圓是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王和王妃從深眠中醒來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這些孩子們...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了Precure的奮鬥？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好熱鬧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 都是怎麼寫的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:12.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,解開了國王和王妃的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:18.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,並且拯救了藍色護衛隊颯拉拉隊長的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害了！我們是不是成有名人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我剛才給父母打了電話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:29.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,他們也激動得很誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的家人肯定也很喜悅的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:33.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:40.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,終於能讓爸爸媽媽也放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止呢 整個藍天大地舉國歡慶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民眾想見一見Precure的呼聲是越來越強烈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:53.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好難為情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在決定 在廣場舉辦一場巡遊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是凱旋而歸的勝利大巡遊啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 由藍色護衛隊開道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家就請乘著那些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:09.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那些孩子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈... 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:20.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我能騎上去嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的 在藍天大地連小孩子都能騎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:25.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:29.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我來！小蝶姐姐先來騎騎看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真溫柔呢 謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們繞一圈吧 蝶華姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:45.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,距離巡遊還有時間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,練習一下吧 真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 竅門在於...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:56.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咦 嘶 啦嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:06:59.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像聽不懂...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這種感覺啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:05.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咦 嘶 啦嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來很簡單的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先來試試看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:33.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,馭 一不留神都跑到這裡來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學有成功騎上嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微聊聊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用多休養一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵... 你以為我是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:53.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,名不虛傳呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 你成長的速度很快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"別停下腳步 英雄少女"！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:07.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在我躊躇不前的時候 是隊長的這句話在背後推動我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 改變了你的 不僅僅是我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與朋友的邂逅 能開闊世界 能讓你認識到全新的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:39.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這畫的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不正是我和王妃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.35,0:08:49.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫得可太棒了 小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,卟卟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卟卟？是什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這畫的是誰呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:07.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是由由博士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的家！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡也是公主的家啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,這這！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 小公主 這裡的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,天空環境！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,天來接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:42.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,海擴天空 光之美少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那時候相同的光...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.40,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:22.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這裡也有炸麵包球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:25.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦 是麵包炸球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,包麵炸球？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是麵包炸球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:32.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼球...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了 先吃為敬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:44.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 和平時吃的炸麵包有點不同...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對我來說 就是普通的炸麵球啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不同世界的區別啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:11:00.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴和阿翼 與我和小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:05.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,外表看起來沒有區別 卻是實實在在的不同世界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:11.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,彷彿就是奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有著像是從畫書裡奔出來的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:20.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是能乘神奇的大鳥 還是吃到奇妙的炸麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,以及與大家的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,希望這奇蹟能夠永遠長久...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王和王妃找你們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇敢的Precure們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無數次得到你們的救助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們救了公主 解開了我們的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由心地感謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的十分感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一件事... 很重要的事 不知你們能否接受？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶著這孩子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你們 再一次帶著公主回到你們的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:19.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要讓公主去天窗市？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:23.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才又見到爸爸和媽媽的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也想和可愛的小公主一直相伴...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 她可是“命運之子”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:31.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,命運？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在大約1年前...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的 今天的天空特別美...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 確實是非常漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲 最亮星都已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(905,965)}長庚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:13:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哎喲喂...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個小寶寶究竟是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是命運之子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能拯救藍天大地於毀滅的危難之中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毀滅... 我們國家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你們親手養育她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另有預言 在不遠的未來 她將踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在時機到來之前 請你們照料她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是養父母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們作為父母的時候 可能只是一瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此還願意的話 請握住她的手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要是拒絕的話 她會怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會去尋找其他的適合人選
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的 讓我也抱抱她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是多麼的可愛 又是多麼的幼小
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 猶如在遙遠夜空中閃耀的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安心吧 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.35,0:14:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空... 就給她取名天空吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:48.57,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天開始 這裡就是你的家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是你的爸爸媽媽哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:59.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空是從天而降的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在 小公主又迸發出了命運的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們心有不捨 但這是她將踏上旅途的信號吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想和你在這裡一起生活的... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:23.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,摸摸 摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:32.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不哭 不哭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖 乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經是個溫柔的孩子了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 肯定沒有問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使離開了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有著能保護你的 溫暖的家和家人們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.51,0:16:02.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,家人...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國肯定會繼續向藍天大地 和你們那邊派出刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不住啊 要讓你們背負危險
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還請你們一定要保護天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:33.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下 王妃殿下...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:38.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我將一如既往 保護好小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會負責的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你們了 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 我們給你們開道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 這次是最後一次陪著你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要與你無可替代的伙伴們 一同走你們自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:05.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:15.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我不拿著 也能夠再見到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我會保護藍天大地的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論何時 都將是你們堅強的後盾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:28.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,馭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:36.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 挺溜的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 是惡作劇雲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:47.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是指在大晴天的時候 偏偏出現一朵黑雲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在藍天大地被叫做惡作劇雲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的慶賀給糟蹋了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.48,0:18:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 難得有一個晴朗的好日子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:06.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能做點什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:11.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓小空見到藍天大地的萬里晴空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:14.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:16.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
