Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不僅僅是現在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:50.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還有未來...啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,譜寫這段歷史 開闢新的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將來一定會...
